<h1>Booking Confirmation</h1>
<p>Hello <%= @passenger.name %>!</p>
<p>Your flight has been booked successfully.</p>
<p>
  Departure: <%= @passenger.booking.flight.departure_airport.code %><br>
  Arrival: <%= @passenger.booking.flight.arrival_airport.code %><br>
  Date: <%= @passenger.booking.flight.start_datetime %>
</p>